category: Libs
requires: cygwin libboost_system1.66 libcaffe1.0.0 libgcc1 libgflags2.2 libglog2 libleveldb1 libopencv3.4 libprotobuf32 libstdc++6
sdesc: "Fast open framework for deep learning (utilities)"
ldesc: "Caffe is a deep learning framework made with expression, speed, and modularity
in mind. It is developed by Berkeley AI Research (BAIR)/The Berkeley Vision
and Learning Center (BVLC) and community contributors."

